### Rule: A new provenance class updates every query that classifies provenance [CXC-SCL-PROVENANCE-CLASSES]

- rule: "A `provenance` value begins with one of david-ruling, david-approval, david-selection or architect-synthesis; a david-selection copies the label exactly, names the DSD and decision, and names the label's author; a spec that adds a class updates [CXC-PC-ARCHITECT-PROPOSALS] `how-to-list`."
